!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/valid/a-tag-naming-the-variant-beside-a-nested-choice-selects-it-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4 (nested choices, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    At `( boolean | narrow )`, `!boolean` names a variant, so it selects it and `true` is read there. The choice is
    not disjoint, a nested choice having no class, so the tag is required of every value of it.
    """
  valid: _
}
